  "steps": [
    "Drain the soaked kala chana and pressure-cook with 3 cups of water and half the salt for 6-7 whistles until soft.",
    "Heat the oil in a pan, add cumin seeds and cinnamon stick and let them sizzle.",
    "Add the onion and cook for 8 minutes until deep golden brown.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste for 1 minute, then the tomato puree and cook until the oil separates.",
    "Stir in turmeric, chilli powder, coriander powder and chole masala and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked chana with its liquid and remaining salt, and simmer for 12-15 minutes until the gravy thickens.",
    "Garnish with coriander leaves and serve with rice or roti."
  ]
